        "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/googlehealth.nutrition.readonly",
        "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/googlehealth.profile.readonly",
        "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/googlehealth.settings.readonly",
        "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/googlehealth.sleep.readonly"
      ],
      "note": "This entry was first written by assuming the pattern of the data-point operations and was wrong in both directions — it listed location.readonly, which this page does not, and omitted settings.readonly, which it does. The check caught it before release, which is the argument for the check."
    },
