        "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/googlehealth.reproductive_health.writeonly",
        "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/googlehealth.sleep.writeonly"
      ],
      "note": "Watched because location.writeonly now rests on this page alone. Discovery revision 20260826 withdrew the scope; this page still lists it, and the SDK keeps the constant on that basis. If the page stops listing it, the constant has no source left and the decision has to be revisited."
    },
    {
